# Mongoose Lizard's mountaincycling {2} (CR 702.29e): paying {2} and discarding it from the hand finds the Mountain in the
# library and puts it into the hand. The cost is paid exactly with Mana Crypt's {C}{C}, and the pool ends empty; with only
# Blasted Landscape's {C} the ability is not offered. The Lizard is in the graveyard, not on the battlefield, so its enters
# trigger never happens.

[Bot1 Deck]
Blasted Landscape
Mana Crypt
Mongoose Lizard
Plains x4
Mountain
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Blasted Landscape.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Mongoose Lizard.Activate(Ability: Mountaincycling; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mana Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mana Crypt.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mongoose Lizard.Activate(Ability: Mountaincycling)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Search(Mountain)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Mountain; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Mongoose Lizard
Bot2.Life = 20
